<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>4.<sp/>API<sp/>Design<sp/>and<sp/>Integration</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>functionality<sp/>is<sp/>structured<sp/>to<sp/>preserve<sp/>backward<sp/>compatibility<sp/>while<sp/>providing<sp/>the<sp/>brute-force<sp/>implementation<sp/>for<sp/>reference<sp/>and<sp/>validation:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>**Explicit<sp/>Implementations**:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>`hmap::sdf_2d_polyline_bvh`<sp/>and<sp/>`hmap::path_sdf_to_array_bvh`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>`hmap::sdf_2d_polyline_brute_force`<sp/>and<sp/>`hmap::path_sdf_to_array_brute_force`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>**Default<sp/>Wrapper<sp/>Functions**:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>`hmap::sdf_2d_polyline(path,<sp/>shape,<sp/>bbox,<sp/>p_noise_x,<sp/>p_noise_y,<sp/>use_bvh<sp/>=<sp/>true)`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>`hmap::path_sdf_to_array(path,<sp/>shape,<sp/>bbox_array,<sp/>p_noise_x,<sp/>p_noise_y,<sp/>use_bvh<sp/>=<sp/>true)`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Existing<sp/>call<sp/>sites<sp/>retain<sp/>default<sp/>`use_bvh<sp/>=<sp/>true`<sp/>behavior<sp/>without<sp/>signature<sp/>breakage.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>5.<sp/>Verification<sp/>of<sp/>Bézier<sp/>Polyline<sp/>SDF<sp/>(`sdf_2d_polyline_bezier`)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">During<sp/>verification<sp/>of<sp/>`sdf_2d_polyline_bezier`,<sp/>numerical<sp/>issues<sp/>were<sp/>discovered<sp/>causing<sp/>corrupted/broken<sp/>results<sp/>(entire<sp/>arrays<sp/>returning<sp/>`NaN`<sp/>or<sp/>`inf`).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Root<sp/>Cause<sp/>Analysis</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>**Division<sp/>by<sp/>Zero<sp/>on<sp/>Colinear/Degenerate<sp/>Segments**:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>The<sp/>distance<sp/>to<sp/>a<sp/>quadratic<sp/>Bézier<sp/>curve<sp/>$B(t)<sp/>=<sp/>(1-t)^2<sp/>P_0<sp/>+<sp/>2t(1-t)P_1<sp/>+<sp/>t^2<sp/>P_2$<sp/>involves<sp/>the<sp/>second-difference<sp/>vector:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>$$b<sp/>=<sp/>P_0<sp/>-<sp/>2P_1<sp/>+<sp/>P_2$$</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>When<sp/>the<sp/>control<sp/>points<sp/>are<sp/>colinear<sp/>(or<sp/>$P_1$<sp/>is<sp/>at<sp/>the<sp/>midpoint<sp/>of<sp/>$P_0$<sp/>and<sp/>$P_2$),<sp/>$b<sp/>\approx<sp/>0<sp/>\implies<sp/>\text{dot}(b,<sp/>b)<sp/>=<sp/>0$.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>The<sp/>original<sp/>code<sp/>computed:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>```cpp</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>float<sp/>kk<sp/>=<sp/>1.0f<sp/>/<sp/>dot(b,<sp/>b);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>without<sp/>checking<sp/>for<sp/>zero.<sp/>This<sp/>produced<sp/>`inf`,<sp/>which<sp/>cascaded<sp/>through<sp/>Cardano&apos;s<sp/>cubic<sp/>solver<sp/>into<sp/>`NaN`<sp/>for<sp/>all<sp/>grid<sp/>queries.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>**Fix**:<sp/>When<sp/>$\text{dot}(b,<sp/>b)<sp/>&lt;<sp/>10^{-10}$,<sp/>the<sp/>curve<sp/>degenerates<sp/>to<sp/>a<sp/>straight<sp/>line<sp/>segment<sp/>$[P_0,<sp/>P_2]$.<sp/>The<sp/>solver<sp/>directly<sp/>evaluates<sp/>the<sp/>point-to-line-segment<sp/>distance.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>**Domain<sp/>Violations<sp/>in<sp/>Trigonometric<sp/>Cardano<sp/>Branch**:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>For<sp/>the<sp/>3-real-roots<sp/>case<sp/>($h<sp/>&lt;<sp/>0$<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>cubic<sp/>discriminant),<sp/>the<sp/>solution<sp/>evaluates:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>```cpp</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>float<sp/>v<sp/>=<sp/>std::acos(q<sp/>/<sp/>(p<sp/>*<sp/>zz<sp/>*<sp/>2.0f))<sp/>/<sp/>3.0f;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>Due<sp/>to<sp/>float32<sp/>precision<sp/>limits,<sp/>$\frac{q}{2<sp/>p<sp/>z}$<sp/>occasionally<sp/>evaluated<sp/>to<sp/>$1.0000002$<sp/>or<sp/>$-1.0000002$,<sp/>triggering<sp/>domain<sp/>errors<sp/>in<sp/>`std::acos`<sp/>and<sp/>returning<sp/>`NaN`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>**Fix**:<sp/>Clamped<sp/>the<sp/>ratio<sp/>to<sp/>$[-1.0f,<sp/>1.0f]$<sp/>via<sp/>`std::clamp`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">3.<sp/>**Topology<sp/>and<sp/>Point<sp/>Count<sp/>Handling**:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>Quadratic<sp/>Bézier<sp/>paths<sp/>are<sp/>indexed<sp/>as<sp/>triplets<sp/>$(P_{2k},<sp/>P_{2k+1},<sp/>P_{2k+2})$.<sp/>Paths<sp/>with<sp/>an<sp/>even<sp/>number<sp/>of<sp/>points<sp/>previously<sp/>appended<sp/>a<sp/>synthetic<sp/>point<sp/>that<sp/>was<sp/>frequently<sp/>colinear<sp/>with<sp/>the<sp/>last<sp/>segment,<sp/>triggering<sp/>the<sp/>division<sp/>by<sp/>zero.<sp/>Proper<sp/>segment<sp/>pairing<sp/>was<sp/>enforced.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>BVH2D<sp/>Acceleration<sp/>for<sp/>Bézier<sp/>Curves</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Since<sp/>quadratic<sp/>Bézier<sp/>curves<sp/>satisfy<sp/>the<sp/>convex<sp/>hull<sp/>property:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">$$B(t)<sp/>\in<sp/>\text{ConvexHull}(P_0,<sp/>P_1,<sp/>P_2)<sp/>\quad<sp/>\forall<sp/>t<sp/>\in<sp/>[0,<sp/>1]$$</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">A<sp/>tight<sp/>and<sp/>conservative<sp/>bounding<sp/>box<sp/>for<sp/>each<sp/>quadratic<sp/>curve<sp/>is<sp/>simply:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">$$\text{AABB}<sp/>=<sp/>[\min(P_0,<sp/>P_1,<sp/>P_2),<sp/>\max(P_0,<sp/>P_1,<sp/>P_2)]$$</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">A<sp/>specialized<sp/>`BVH2DBezier`<sp/>tree<sp/>was<sp/>implemented<sp/>using<sp/>this<sp/>bounding<sp/>box<sp/>representation.<sp/>Per-pixel<sp/>queries<sp/>prune<sp/>subtrees<sp/>whose<sp/>bounding<sp/>box<sp/>distance<sp/>exceeds<sp/>the<sp/>current<sp/>closest<sp/>squared<sp/>distance.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>API<sp/>was<sp/>structured<sp/>consistently<sp/>with<sp/>linear<sp/>polyline<sp/>SDF:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>`hmap::sdf_2d_polyline_bezier_bvh`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>`hmap::sdf_2d_polyline_bezier_brute_force`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>`hmap::sdf_2d_polyline_bezier(path,<sp/>shape,<sp/>bbox,<sp/>p_noise_x,<sp/>p_noise_y,<sp/>use_bvh<sp/>=<sp/>true)`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>6.<sp/>GPU<sp/>(OpenCL)<sp/>Assessment<sp/>and<sp/>Validation</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>GPU<sp/>polyline<sp/>SDF<sp/>implementation<sp/>was<sp/>analyzed<sp/>to<sp/>determine<sp/>whether<sp/>introducing<sp/>a<sp/>BVH2D<sp/>spatial<sp/>index<sp/>in<sp/>OpenCL<sp/>kernels<sp/>would<sp/>yield<sp/>benefits.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Performance<sp/>Analysis:<sp/>GPU<sp/>Brute<sp/>Force<sp/>vs<sp/>CPU<sp/>BVH2D</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Comparative<sp/>benchmark<sp/>timings<sp/>on<sp/>an<sp/>NVIDIA<sp/>GeForce<sp/>GTX<sp/>1650<sp/>Max-Q<sp/>across<sp/>$512<sp/>\times<sp/>512$<sp/>grids:</highlight></codeline>
