<codeline><highlight class="normal">|---|---|---|---|---|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>10<sp/>|<sp/>49.3<sp/>|<sp/>6.7<sp/>|<sp/>1.9<sp/>|<sp/>~3.5x<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>50<sp/>|<sp/>258.0<sp/>|<sp/>12.2<sp/>|<sp/>2.1<sp/>|<sp/>~5.8x<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>200<sp/>|<sp/>973.0<sp/>|<sp/>20.2<sp/>|<sp/>2.8<sp/>|<sp/>~7.2x<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>1000<sp/>|<sp/>4949.6<sp/>|<sp/>37.6<sp/>|<sp/>5.6<sp/>|<sp/>~6.7x<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Rationale:<sp/>Keeping<sp/>the<sp/>GPU<sp/>Kernel<sp/>Brute<sp/>Force</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Building<sp/>and<sp/>traversing<sp/>a<sp/>BVH2D<sp/>on<sp/>the<sp/>GPU<sp/>was<sp/>rejected<sp/>based<sp/>on<sp/>execution<sp/>characteristics:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>**Constant<sp/>Memory<sp/>Broadcast<sp/>Efficiency**:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>Path<sp/>vertices<sp/>are<sp/>placed<sp/>in<sp/>`__constant<sp/>float*`<sp/>(or<sp/>read-only<sp/>global<sp/>cache<sp/>lines).<sp/>During<sp/>execution,<sp/>all<sp/>32<sp/>threads<sp/>in<sp/>an<sp/>execution<sp/>warp<sp/>evaluate<sp/>the<sp/>identical<sp/>segment<sp/>index<sp/>simultaneously:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Warp<sp/>broadcast<sp/>achieves<sp/>a<sp/>100%<sp/>cache<sp/>hit<sp/>rate<sp/>with<sp/>zero<sp/>memory<sp/>latency<sp/>penalty.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Brute-force<sp/>loop<sp/>execution<sp/>exhibits<sp/>zero<sp/>warp<sp/>divergence.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>**Warp<sp/>Divergence<sp/>in<sp/>BVH<sp/>Traversal**:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>Neighboring<sp/>pixels<sp/>traverse<sp/>different<sp/>branches<sp/>of<sp/>a<sp/>BVH<sp/>depending<sp/>on<sp/>their<sp/>spatial<sp/>coordinates.<sp/>Per-warp<sp/>branch<sp/>divergence<sp/>on<sp/>a<sp/>tree<sp/>traversal<sp/>serializes<sp/>execution<sp/>threads<sp/>and<sp/>requires<sp/>a<sp/>per-work-item<sp/>stack<sp/>(causing<sp/>register<sp/>pressure<sp/>or<sp/>spilling<sp/>into<sp/>high-latency<sp/>local/private<sp/>memory).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">3.<sp/>**Performance<sp/>Trade-Off**:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>At<sp/>$N<sp/>=<sp/>1000$<sp/>segments,<sp/>the<sp/>brute-force<sp/>GPU<sp/>kernel<sp/>takes<sp/>only<sp/>5.6<sp/>ms.<sp/>The<sp/>complexity<sp/>of<sp/>dynamic<sp/>tree<sp/>traversal<sp/>in<sp/>OpenCL<sp/>would<sp/>likely<sp/>degrade<sp/>throughput<sp/>rather<sp/>than<sp/>improve<sp/>it<sp/>for<sp/>typical<sp/>path<sp/>sizes.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Numerical<sp/>Stability<sp/>and<sp/>Parity<sp/>Fixes<sp/>on<sp/>GPU</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>OpenCL<sp/>kernels<sp/>were<sp/>reviewed<sp/>and<sp/>aligned<sp/>with<sp/>the<sp/>CPU<sp/>implementations:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>**Colinear<sp/>Bézier<sp/>Segments**:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>In<sp/>`HighMap/src/gpu_opencl/kernels/transform/sdf_2d_polyline.cl`,<sp/>added<sp/>a<sp/>check<sp/>for<sp/>$b\_len\_sq<sp/>=<sp/>\text{dot}(b,<sp/>b)<sp/>&lt;<sp/>10^{-10}\text{f}$.<sp/>When<sp/>degenerate,<sp/>the<sp/>kernel<sp/>falls<sp/>back<sp/>to<sp/>line<sp/>segment<sp/>distance<sp/>between<sp/>endpoints,<sp/>preventing<sp/>division-by-zero<sp/>`inf`<sp/>and<sp/>`NaN`<sp/>cascades.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>**Cardano<sp/>Root<sp/>Solver<sp/>Clamping**:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>Clamped<sp/>`acos`<sp/>argument<sp/>to<sp/>$[-1.0\text{f},<sp/>1.0\text{f}]$<sp/>within<sp/>the<sp/>3-real-roots<sp/>cubic<sp/>solver<sp/>branch<sp/>to<sp/>avoid<sp/>domain<sp/>errors<sp/>from<sp/>float<sp/>rounding.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">3.<sp/>**Closed<sp/>Path<sp/>Signing<sp/>and<sp/>Topology**:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>`gpu::sdf_2d_polyline_bezier`<sp/>now<sp/>appends<sp/>the<sp/>closing<sp/>segment<sp/>to<sp/>reconnect<sp/>the<sp/>first<sp/>and<sp/>last<sp/>control<sp/>points<sp/>when<sp/>`path.is_closed()<sp/>==<sp/>true`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>The<sp/>kernel<sp/>takes<sp/>an<sp/>`is_closed`<sp/>parameter<sp/>and<sp/>computes<sp/>ray-crossing<sp/>parity<sp/>to<sp/>assign<sp/>interior<sp/>negative<sp/>signs,<sp/>matching<sp/>the<sp/>CPU<sp/>signed<sp/>distance<sp/>field<sp/>behavior.</highlight></codeline>
